  "conclusions": [
    "All seven production diffs regenerate exactly from immutable actual33 sources; old seven sources and test match their actual33 input SHA and seven-field stamps. No original qualification is relabeled onto new source.",
    "Descriptor and all six consumers bind the same installation05 paths and 24/9/8 capacity. Exact preflight05 descriptor selects packet, work, supervisor, launcher, preparation and future saved-audit route; no old04 success substitution.",
    "Entry takes the owning canonical lock and fresh24 check before full frozen/provider/Reader guards, then injects a distinct authenticated installation Controller. The already-held FD validator, per-child/full-current guards and operational wait tails remain unchanged.",
    "Fresh controls gate authenticates all seven installation sources plus test_installation; old33 checks are explicitly redirected to immutable preflight05, old52 remains SOURCE04, and startup39 remains old environment/owner. Actual future installation and preflight audit digests remain external and unbound.",
    "Preparer retains complete prior packet/work plus supervisor/launcher/preparation trees; completed_preflight binds exact two typed children, route, raw plan/input/result/receipt/outer/launcher hashes to the independent preflight audit, then invokes unchanged preflight_history.validate for actual recipe/raw diagnostics/current retained sources.",
    "completed_catalog and full v2 physical EOF loop are AST-identical; the additional success owner is only source_preflight after unchanged history validation. It follows prior continued/failed/hash catalog, and its callback compares authenticated complete saved objects without recursion.",
    "The final specification and installation recipe remain original code: final identity includes actual preflight and policy references; sorted loader probes plus three compiler identity/capability calls and two expected E0080 source probes produce len(loader)+5 children. New Controller checks exact desired recipe, every child/order/environment and publication completion.",
    "Owner startup change preserves exact passed/observed/workload maps and preparation-before-runtime chronology; adds exact external source-preflight audit and separate installation controls to actual command/invocation checks. No environment deletion, fabricated observation or future passed audit is introduced.",
    "25 distinct fixture methods directly exercise route, phase/capacity, separate proof callbacks and prerequisite handoff/owner association with negative cases. The mock history callback tests routing/refusal only and is explicitly not a substitute for actual two-probe history."
  ],
